AltoRewardsDistributor::setMerkleRootUpdater
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when updater status equals current status
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when updater status is different from current status
        ├── when setting a normal different status
        │   ├── it should update merkle root updater status
        │   └── it should emit SetMerkleRootUpdater event
        ├── when removing existing updater
        │   ├── it should update merkle root updater status
        │   └── it should emit SetMerkleRootUpdater event
        ├── when adding new updater
        │   ├── it should update merkle root updater status
        │   └── it should emit SetMerkleRootUpdater event
        ├── when toggling same updater multiple times
        │   ├── it should update merkle root updater status for each call
        │   └── it should emit SetMerkleRootUpdater event for each call
        ├── when managing multiple updaters
        │   ├── it should update merkle root updater status for each updater
        │   └── it should maintain independent states for each updater
        └── when setting owner as updater
            ├── it should update merkle root updater status
            └── it should emit SetMerkleRootUpdater event
